flowchart LR
    A[CSV salaries + KPI] --> B[Initialize Job]
    A --> R[Python calculates expected amount]
    B --> C[Create context and keys]
    C --> D[Encrypt salaries and KPI]
    D --> P[Node3 port-forward 127.0.0.1:15432]
    P <--> E[(PostgreSQL)]
    R --> T[(he_demo_results)]
    P --> F[SUM Job]
    F --> P
    P --> G[Multiply Job]
    G --> P
    P --> H[Verify Job uses secret key]
    H --> I[Decrypted amount + error]
    I --> T
